//               carried (the panel's comment said so), and the panel's own clock, as a library package.
//
// Description : A TimeSpan as text. RDCTimeSpanToClock gives "HH:MM:SS", with the days in front as "D:"
//               when there are any - the form for a clock a person watches while something runs, where
//               milliseconds only jitter. RDCTimeSpanToString adds them, ".mmm", zero-padded - the form
//               for the summary of a run, where they say something: 1.007 seconds reads "00:00:01.007".
//
